<title>POLAND: SWARZEDZ TURNS TO PLN 38.6 MLN LOSS IN 96.</title>
<headline>SWARZEDZ TURNS TO PLN 38.6 MLN LOSS IN 96.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 4.90 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   4.90 vs   0.02</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.07 vs   1.02</p>
<p> Sales		    9.93 vs   9.87</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		38.59 vs   1.19 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	  38.48 vs   3.00 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	22.69 vs  13.29 profit</p>
<p> Sales		  106.87 vs 101.30</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish furniture producer is</p>
<p>Swarzedzkie Fabryki Mebli SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
